WEBVTT

00:26:58.516 --> 00:27:00.276
and your time in public health?

00:27:00.916 --> 00:27:03.516
AF: Yeah, David, there are so many things,

00:27:03.556 --> 00:27:05.396
but I think one thing that stands out,

00:27:05.396 --> 00:27:07.636
particularly in the climate
and the environment

00:27:07.676 --> 00:27:09.356
that we're in right now,

00:27:09.396 --> 00:27:14.956
is that people need to get involved
in a proactive way

00:27:14.996 --> 00:27:19.996
in spreading the truth
about what scientific principles are

00:27:20.036 --> 00:27:21.196
and what they mean

00:27:21.236 --> 00:27:25.556
and how they can be
of great benefit to society

00:27:25.596 --> 00:27:32.276
and to try and make our population
more science literate than it is right now